// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <dt-bindings/zmk/mouse.h>
#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/backlight.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/outputs.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

#define BSE 0
#define LWR 1
#define RSE 2
#define ADJ 3
#define SYM 4
#define ZMK_MOUSE_DEFAULT_MOVE_VAL 1500  // 600
#define ZMK_MOUSE_DEFAULT_SCRL_VAL 5     // 10

// mouse movement

&mmv {
    acceleration-exponent = <1>;      // 1
    time-to-max-speed-ms = <500>;     // 300
    delay-ms = <0>;                   // 0
};

&mt {
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <200>;
    quick-tap-ms = <170>;
    require-prior-idle-ms = <30>;
};

&lt {
    quick-tap-ms = <250>; // This allows the tapped key to be repeated.
    tapping-term-ms = <250>;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    require-prior-idle-ms = <125>;
};

// mod_morph keys
// tap: qmark | shift + tap: excl
ZMK_BEHAVIOR(qexcl, mod_morph,
    bindings = <&kp QMARK>, <&kp EXCL>;
    mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
)

// tap: comma | shift + tap: semicolon 
ZMK_BEHAVIOR(comma_morph, mod_morph,
    bindings = <&kp COMMA>, <&kp SEMICOLON>;
    mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
)

// tap: dot | shift + tap: colon 
ZMK_BEHAVIOR(dot_morph, mod_morph,
    bindings = <&kp DOT>, <&kp COLON>;
    mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
)

/ {
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        combo_scrolllock {
            bindings = <&kp SCROLLLOCK>;
            key-positions = <29 28>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_esc {
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
            key-positions = <0 1>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_caps {
            bindings = <&kp CAPS>;
            key-positions = <10 11>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_tab {
            bindings = <&kp TAB>;
            key-positions = <20 21>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_minus {
            bindings = <&kp MINUS>;
            key-positions = <20 21>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

       combo_lpar {
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <6 7>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

       combo_rpar {
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>;
            key-positions = <7 8>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_quote {
            bindings = <&kp SINGLE_QUOTE>;
            key-positions = <18 19>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };
    };

    behaviors {
        // Create custom behavior that is similar to the global `&mt`
        // configuration, but sets longer `tapping-term-ms`. This makes
        // it more difficult to trigger the hold behavior.
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        bse_layer {
            bindings = <
&kp Q             &kp W        &kp E           &kp R           &kp T            &kp Y        &kp U              &kp I            &kp O              &kp P
&mt LCTRL A  &mt LEFT_ALT S  &mt LEFT_GUI D  &mt LEFT_SHIFT F  &kp G            &kp H        &mt RIGHT_SHIFT J  &mt RIGHT_GUI K  &mt RIGHT_ALT L    &mt RCTRL SEMICOLON
&kp Z             &kp X        &kp C           &kp V           &kp B            &kp N        &kp M              &kp COMMA        &kp DOT            &kp FSLH
                                               &lt 1 DELETE    &lt 2 RETURN     &lt 3 SPACE  &lt 4 BACKSPACE
            >;

            sensor-bindings = <&inc_dec_kp LC(RIGHT_ARROW) LC(LEFT_ARROW) &inc_dec_kp LS(HOME) LS(END)>;
        };


        lwr_layer {
            bindings = <
&kp C_NEXT        &kp LS(LC(LEFT))  &kp LS(HOME)    &kp LS(END)   &kp LC(LS(RIGHT))  &kp HOME        &kp UP_ARROW   &kp END     &kp PG_UP          &mkp MB3
&kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &msc SCRL_LEFT    &msc SCRL_DOWN  &msc SCRL_UP  &msc SCRL_RIGHT    &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW  &kp PAGE_DOWN  &mkp MB1
&kp C_PREVIOUS    &kp LC(X)         &kp LC(C)       &kp LC(V)     &trans             &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_UP  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &mkp MB2
                                                    &kp ESCAPE    &kp ENTER          &trans          &trans
            >;

            sensor-bindings = <&inc_dec_kp LS(LC(RIGHT_ARROW)) LS(LC(LEFT_ARROW)) &inc_dec_kp C_VOL_UP C_VOL_DN>;
        };


        rse_layer {
            bindings = <
&kp EXCLAMATION  &kp AT_SIGN  &kp HASH  &kp DOLLAR   &kp PERCENT       &kp CARET       &kp AMPERSAND   &kp ASTERISK  &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS
&kp N1           &kp N2       &kp N3    &kp N4       &kp N5            &kp N6          &kp N7          &kp N8        &kp N9                &kp N0
&kp F1           &kp F2       &kp F3    &kp UP_ARROW &kp DOWN_ARROW    &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp RIGHT_ARROW &kp F8        &kp F9                &kp F10
                                        &kp F11      &trans            &kp ENTER       &kp F12
            >;
        };


        adj_layer {
            bindings = <
&bt BT_CLR_ALL  &bt BT_CLR  &out OUT_TOG  &bl BL_TOG  &kp KP_NUMLOCK &kp KP_MINUS     &kp KP_NUMBER_7  &kp KP_NUMBER_8  &kp KP_NUMBER_9  &kp KP_SLASH
&bootloader     &bt BT_NXT  &bt BT_SEL 0  &bl BL_INC  &trans         &kp KP_NUMBER_0  &kp KP_NUMBER_4  &kp KP_NUMBER_5  &kp KP_NUMBER_6  &kp KP_DOT
&trans          &bt BT_PRV  &bt BT_SEL 1  &bl BL_DEC  &trans         &kp KP_PLUS      &kp KP_NUMBER_1  &kp KP_NUMBER_2  &kp KP_NUMBER_3  &kp KP_ASTERISK
                                          &trans      &kp BACKSPACE  &kp SPACE        &kp KP_ENTER
            >;
        };


        sym_layer {
            bindings = <
&kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp LEFT_BRACE  &trans  &trans   &trans         &trans     &trans  &trans  &kp RIGHT_BRACE    &kp RIGHT_BRACKET
&kp GRAVE         &trans          &trans  &trans   &trans         &trans     &trans  &trans  &trans             &kp SINGLE_QUOTE
&kp MINUS         &trans          &trans  &trans   &trans         &trans     &trans  &trans  &trans             &kp EQUAL
                                          &kp TAB  &kp BACKSPACE  &kp SPACE  &trans
            >;
        };
    };
 };
